                                "sense_id": "8eea884f-165e-3a66-99bb-c854f2dc2412",
                                "text": "The best fumer concepts evaluated to date employ pyrotechnic type mixes with additives (burning rate modifiers, gaseous output modifiers) and/or gas flow-restricting baseplates."
