                                "sense_id": "8eea884f-165e-3a66-99bb-c854f2dc2412",
                                "text": "Tracers and fumers are small, smoke producing charges that are placed in projectiles. […] A fumer produces smoke at the proper rate to fill the partial vacuum that movement through the air creates behind the projectile."
